After pulling out the leading PN scaling, we just get back the horizon energy \
flux:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.991653213949543*^9, 
  3.9916532340415983`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6dd293f7-d231-4500-bda8-\
